// The compilation context (0.26.5, statics P4): what were the statics of
// base, front, places and the tools, one field each, made once per process
// by main and passed down last as `pcx` (tools/statics/p4-ctx.group,
// `volec fix --only statics`). A field keeps its static's first value and
// lives as long as the process did. The comment above a field names the
// static it was.

